{% comment %}
  This section is used in the list-collections template to render a list of
  collections. Restyled per spec section 5.10 with three real functional
  additions beyond a style pass: pagination, an empty-state message, and a
  card layout that matches the theme's established card conventions instead
  of the previous unstyled grid.

  Pagination follows the exact paginate tag pattern already used
  identically in sections/blog.liquid, sections/search.liquid, and
  sections/collection.liquid — same default_pagination filter, same
  aria-label convention, no new pagination component invented. 24 per page
  matches sections/collection.liquid's own product-grid page size, a
  reasonable fit for a grid of small collection cards.

  collection.featured_image's fallback to a member product's image is
  already handled natively by Shopify itself — confirmed against
  https://shopify.dev/docs/api/liquid/objects/collection, whose documented
  description for featured_image reads (verbatim): "The featured image for
  the collection. The default is the collection image. If this image isn't
  available, then Shopify falls back to the featured image of the first
  product in the collection. If the first product in the collection doesn't
  have a featured image, then nil is returned." So the existing
  featured_image conditional below already renders the
  first-product fallback image whenever a collection has none of its own —
  there is no separate collection.products.first.featured_image lookup to
  write, and that path was never the documented way to reach this value.
  The card below explicitly passes alt: collection.title into
  snippets/image.liquid rather than relying on that snippet's own
  image.alt default -- when the fallback kicks in, the rendered image's
  own alt text describes the member product it was borrowed from, not
  the collection this card represents, which would otherwise announce
  the wrong name to screen reader users.

  Untruncated collection.title is carried forward unchanged (no truncate
  filter applied), matching spec section 5.10's explicit requirement.

  Card visual conventions (media/content stack, --space-* gaps, an
  image-placeholder fallback) mirror snippets/product-card.liquid and
  sections/blog.liquid's article-card so this grid doesn't look like an
  unstyled generic grid next to the rest of the theme. The merchant-facing
  grid_item_width/grid_gap settings from the original stub are preserved
  as-is (auto-fill grid sizing is a real, working customization point, not
  something this task needed to remove).

  https://shopify.dev/docs/storefronts/themes/architecture/templates/collection
{% endcomment %}

<div class="collections-page full-width">
  <h1 class="collections-page__title">{{ 'collections.title' | t }}</h1>

  {% paginate collections by 24 %}
    {% if collections.size > 0 %}
      <div
        class="collections {{ section.settings.grid_item_width }}"
        style="--grid-gap: {{ section.settings.grid_gap }}px"
      >
        {% for collection in collections %}
          <a class="collection-card" href="{{ collection.url }}">
            <div class="collection-card__media">
              {% if collection.featured_image %}
                {% render 'image',
                  image: collection.featured_image,
                  class: 'collection-card__image',
                  width: 600,
                  height: 600,
                  crop: 'center',
                  alt: collection.title
                %}
              {% else %}
                <div class="collection-card__image collection-card__image--placeholder"></div>
              {% endif %}
            </div>

            <div class="collection-card__content">
              <h2 class="collection-card__title">{{ collection.title }}</h2>

              {% if collection.description != blank %}
                <p class="collection-card__description">{{ collection.description | strip_html | truncatewords: 15 }}</p>
              {% endif %}
            </div>
          </a>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>

      {% if paginate.pages > 1 %}
        <nav class="collections-page__pagination" aria-label="{{ 'collections.pagination' | t }}">
          {{ paginate | default_pagination }}
        </nav>
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      <p class="collections-page__empty">{{ 'collections.empty' | t }}</p>
    {% endif %}
  {% endpaginate %}
</div>

{% stylesheet %}
  .collections-page {
    padding-block: var(--space-8);
    padding-inline: var(--space-4);
  }
  @media (min-width: 750px) {
    .collections-page {
      padding-inline: var(--space-6);
    }
  }
  .collections-page__title {
    font-family: var(--font-header--family);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    text-align: center;
    margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
  }
  .collections {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(min(var(--collection-card-size), 100%), 1fr));
    gap: var(--grid-gap);
  }
  .collections--compact {
    --collection-card-size: 160px;
  }
  .collections--full {
    --collection-card-size: 280px;
  }
  .collection-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
    width: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--color-foreground);
  }
  .collection-card__media {
    position: relative;
  }
  .collection-card__image--placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    background-color: var(--color-background-alt);
  }
  .collection-card__title {
    font-family: var(--font-header--family);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .collection-card__description {
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .collections-page__pagination {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .collections-page__pagination a {
    min-width: 24px;
    min-height: 24px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: var(--space-2);
  }
  .collections-page__empty {
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--color-foreground-muted);
    padding-block: var(--space-8);
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:general.collections_grid",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "grid_item_width",
      "label": "t:labels.grid_item_width",
      "options": [
        { "value": "collections--compact", "label": "t:options.size.small" },
        { "value": "collections--full", "label": "t:options.size.large" }
      ],
      "default": "collections--full"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "grid_gap",
      "label": "t:labels.grid_gap",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 30
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "t:general.collections_grid" }]
}
{% endschema %}
